1
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:42,640
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:47,730
[Episode13: You Are Who You Are.
You Don′t Need to Change.]

3
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,539
Chu Chunsheng, sometimes you're

4
00:01:35,039 --> 00:01:37,170
so sincere that it's almost annoying.

5
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,400
What do you mean?

6
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,700
When you heard I was type O yesterday,

7
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:44,960
your first reaction wasn't
to question or attack me,

8
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,490
but to offer your blessing.

9
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,120
Was your blessing

10
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:50,600
sincere?

11
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,800
I won't give her up

12
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,000
for any possibility.

13
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,720
But I need to tell you,

14
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,720
I'm not type O.

15
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,280
I'm type AB.

16
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,200
So biologically speaking,

17
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,660
I can't possibly be Nannan's father.

18
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:18,680
And Nannan was already conceived

19
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,320
before Nanfeng left Shencheng.

20
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,650
What did the doctor say?

21
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:55,600
The doctor said Nannan is fine.

22
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:57,430
She can be discharged tomorrow.

23
00:03:01,230 --> 00:03:03,430
You haven't slept all night?

24
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,200
I'm fine.

25
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,560
You don't look so good either.

26
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,080
Why don't you go home and rest?

27
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,410
I'll stay here with her.

28
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,200
No need.

29
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,570
Zhi will be here to relieve me soon.

30
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:22,120
Thank you for yesterday.

31
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,800
I should be the one apologizing.

32
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,000
You left

33
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,040
because of Hong, didn't you?

34
00:03:39,610 --> 00:03:42,850
When I signed the prenuptial agreement,

35
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,090
I already sensed something was wrong.

36
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,920
I thought I could

37
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:47,960
explain everything to you later.

38
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,680
But

39
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:52,420
that turned out to be
the last time we saw each other.

40
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:55,740
You've suffered alone all these years.

41
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,000
She...

42
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,850
She couldn't accept me.

43
00:04:02,010 --> 00:04:02,960
It wasn't your fault.

44
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,960
It was mine.

45
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:07,360
I shouldn't have tried
to get her to accept you.

46
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,860
You are who you are.

47
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:11,640
You don't need to change for anyone.

48
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:15,320
If I had another chance,

49
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,610
I would respect every choice you made.

50
00:04:24,390 --> 00:04:26,590
So Hong really did say something to you,

51
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,700
didn't she?

52
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,480
Let me guess.

53
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,610
She paid to restrict your freedom?

54
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:38,800
As expected,

55
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,000
you really do know Hong well.

56
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:43,120
But

57
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,560
I gave her back

58
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,280
that hundred thousand dollars.

59
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:48,800
Every last cent.

60
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,200
Surely I'm worth more than

61
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:54,380
a hundred thousand dollars
to you, aren't I?

62
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,400
Ms. Xie.

63
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:01,540
Is Nannan feeling better?

64
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,920
There's something you should know.

65
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,080
We've had a lot of orders
canceled this morning,

66
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,480
for all sorts of reasons.

67
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,560
I think I know why.

68
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,290
Counterfeit products?

69
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,520
You think so too?

70
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,240
We're gaining momentum right now,

71
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,950
and suddenly, everyone is
canceling their orders.

72
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:22,920
This seems too targeted
to be a coincidence.

73
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,520
A tall tree catches the wind.

74
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,900
The wind's picking up.

75
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:27,280
Even pigs can fly.

76
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:29,360
But knocking down my tree

77
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,000
won't be that easy.

78
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,800
I want to see for myself

79
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,409
just how bad things really are.

80
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,400
Zhi.

81
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,840
I'll leave Nannan to you.

82
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:38,990
Wait.

83
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:40,200
I'm coming with you.

84
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:45,520
Hey, beautiful!

85
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:47,320
Take a look at our underwear,
just like Fashion Flower's.

86
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,320
Why not buy a pair?

87
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,000
Have a look!

88
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,400
I'll give you a better price.

89
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:52,600
Come take a look.

90
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,640
Come take a look!

91
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,700
The latest styles.

92
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:58,080
Exactly like the ones
in department stores.

93
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,320
So comfortable,
you'll barely feel you're wearing them.

94
00:05:59,320 --> 00:05:59,760
Really?

95
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,240
Yes.

96
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,240
Let me take a look.

97
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,860
Thanks, I'll just browse.

98
00:06:09,250 --> 00:06:10,080
I can lower the price a little more.

99
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,160
Come check these out.

100
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,200
The fabric is so soft.

101
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:12,800
Miss,

102
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,280
why not take a few home and try them on?

103
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:16,200
They're much cheaper
than what you'd get at the mall.

104
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:16,860
Take a look.

105
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:19,520
Have a look.

106
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:25,200
[Fashion Flower]

107
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:30,320
Is this stuff really safe to wear?

108
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,480
Won't it cause skin irritation?

109
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,440
Of course not.

110
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:35,080
Same styles as Fashion Flower,
and we're a major brand too!

111
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:35,640
Ma'am,

112
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:37,500
I'll take everything you've got.

113
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,040
How about

114
00:06:45,250 --> 00:06:47,190
we lower our prices too

115
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:49,000
to secure the market first?

116
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:53,240
Starting a price war
is like committing slow suicide.

117
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,770
It would devalue our brand.

118
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,600
If we do that,

119
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:58,400
all our previous efforts
will have been for nothing.

120
00:06:58,400 --> 00:06:59,880
They can copy the look,

121
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,160
but they can't copy what makes us special.

122
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:04,000
What we need to do is break it all down,

123
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,020
piece by piece,

124
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:08,050
and show everyone
exactly what sets us apart.

125
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:13,200
I'm planning to launch
an affordable basic line,

126
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:14,520
with the simplest designs,

127
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,640
the strictest quality control,

128
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:17,440
and the most reasonable prices,

129
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:21,920
to take on these knockoffs head-on.

130
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,760
We want consumers to know

131
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:29,280
what affordable peace of mind
really means.

132
00:07:36,170 --> 00:07:37,810
We can talk about our philosophy all day,

133
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:39,100
[Fashion Flower New Collection Launch
& Anti-Counterfeiting Press Conference]

134
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:40,000
but seeing is believing.

135
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:42,760
Today, we'll show you
in the most direct way

136
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:46,200
what good-quality underwear
really looks like.

137
00:07:52,990 --> 00:07:54,430
Tomatoes?

138
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:58,330
What's this all about?

139
00:08:16,020 --> 00:08:18,000
You can see the two tomatoes I'm holding.

140
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,400
The tomato on my left hand

141
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:21,000
has obvious pressure marks.

142
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:24,400
Inferior fibers only hold things in place
through rigid compression.

143
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,920
And the tomato on my right hand

144
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,900
is one that we've used
with Fashion Flower underwear.

145
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:30,400
Our philosophy has always been

146
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:32,280
comfort, not constriction.

147
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,640
Next, we'll conduct a friction test.

148
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,570
First, let's test Fashion Flower.

149
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:54,040
As you can see, this petal in my hand

150
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:56,000
has no visible marks at all.

151
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,660
That's because Fashion Flower

152
00:08:57,660 --> 00:08:59,940
is all about being gentle on the skin.

153
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,120
Next, let me demonstrate

154
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,520
with a knockoff bra.

155
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,320
As you can see,

156
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,680
after the test,

157
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,480
the knockoff bra has left
obvious abrasion marks on the petal.

158
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:18,010
The petal has become
visibly wilted and dull.

159
00:09:18,830 --> 00:09:20,150
Our skin

160
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,120
deserves even gentler treatment
than a flower petal.

161
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,720
And that's why Fashion Flower underwear

162
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,520
is the genuine article.

163
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,440
We're making these comparisons

164
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,800
not to put anyone down,

165
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,760
but to establish a standard.

166
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,120
So,

167
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:35,340
from today until the end of the month,

168
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:39,000
bring in any knockoff bra

169
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:41,280
and get 10 yuan off

170
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,600
any authentic Fashion Flower product.

171
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:46,000
What's more, all our products

172
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,880
come with a 7-day no-questions-asked
return policy

173
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:49,680
and a 30-day quality guarantee.

174
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,800
Come on, feel this.

175
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:05,000
This is Fashion Flower underwear.

176
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,720
And this is an ordinary one.

177
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:09,220
Excellent.

178
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,200
Of course.

179
00:10:13,790 --> 00:10:14,470
Biao.

180
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,320
Cut the most striking moments
from that experiment

181
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,320
into a short video

182
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:22,400
and send it to the malls and TV stations.

183
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,000
Hurry.

184
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,000
Got it.

185
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,880
We've already got leads

186
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:28,040
on those knockoff workshops.

187
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,240
Don't make a move yet.

188
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,950
Let's wait until her promotional campaign
gains even more traction.

189
00:10:31,950 --> 00:10:33,120
Then we'll hand over all the evidence

190
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:35,320
to the market regulators and the media.

191
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,880
We need to strike accurately,

192
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:37,800
and at the right time.
